  "zh": "# 中国AI模型Gemini 4 Argon发布，OpenAI亮点引关注\n## AI与科技\n- **Gemini 4 Argon**：谷歌发布最新多模态大模型，性能提升显著，引发业界关注。\n- **OpenAI event**：新工具与模型更新预示AI将更深入产业应用。\n## 产业与市场\n- **Memory chip margin**：DRAM与NAND利润创新高，反映全球芯片需求回暖及涨价预期。\n- **BYD Tesla rivalry**：销量数据显示比亚迪在新能源车市场逐步缩小与特斯拉的差距，竞争格局生变。\n## 社会民生\n- **Rider fire blast**：送餐员在扑救火灾中意外遇爆炸，引发对职业安全与应急处理的关注。\n- **25 lb potato diet**：极简土豆饮食案例走红，提示低成本减肥方法的可行性与风险。\n- **Emergency descent**：中东航路客机紧急下降事件突显飞行安全监管的重要性。",
  "en": "# Google releases Gemini 4 Argon, OpenAI event highlights draw attention\n## AI & Tech\n- **Gemini 4 Argon**：Google unveils latest multimodal large model with significant performance gains, attracting industry attention.\n- **OpenAI event**：New tools and model updates signal deeper AI integration into industry applications.\n## Industry & Market\n- **Memory chip margin**：DRAM and NAND profits hit record highs, reflecting recovering global semiconductor demand and price‑rise expectations.\n- **BYD Tesla rivalry**：Sales data show BYD narrowing the gap with Tesla in the EV market, reshaping competitive dynamics.\n## Society\n- **Rider fire blast**：A food‑delivery worker suffers an explosion while fighting a blaze, raising concerns about occupational safety and emergency response.\n- **25 lb potato diet**：An extreme potato‑only diet goes viral, highlighting the feasibility and risks of ultra‑low‑cost weight loss.\n- **Emergency descent**：A Dubai‑to‑Israel flight’s rapid 5000‑meter descent underscores the importance of flight‑safety oversight on Middle Eastern routes."
